model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway.poolMembership {
    metadata {
      constraint "Upstream v2 supplies the active deployment and linking person on its authorized link subquery. PostgreSQL fixtures include both fields for ordinary and contributed-account reads, preserving exact reference, policy-count and lock assertions. Native membership locks its organization-owned app-link candidates in account order, then their bindings, before evaluating current policy once in the final fingerprint query. Lock candidates never grant membership. Exact metadata and ciphertext digests, fresh revocation checks, reference reuse and the five-second authority interval remain unchanged."
    }
  }
}
